To verify the implementation:

1. Run headless tests:
   cargo test -p dust-trail --domain procgen

2. Verify World::generate integrates:
   - World::generate(seed) returns a complete 40×22 world
   - Delegates to procgen::generate(seed)

3. Verify Game integration:
   - Game::new_with_seed(seed) produces deterministic world
   - Game::new() produces random procedural world

4. Check performance (should be <10ms):
   - Time 100 generations: cargo timing test

5. Check CI is green - all tests pass in GitHub Actions